#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. Mix = the game's own TAA blended with DLAA / DLSS: calmer, a bit softer. "
"off = the game's own picture. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = čisté hrany vo vykresľovacej veľkosti hry. DLSS = to isté a zväčšuje, keď je Škálovanie "
"hry pod 100 %. Mix = vlastné TAA hry zmiešané s DLAA / DLSS: pokojnejšie, o trochu mäkšie. vyp. = "
"vlastný obraz hry. Uloží sa hneď."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How much of the Mix is the game's TAA, 0 - 100 % in 10 % steps: more = calmer and softer, less = "
"sharper. Shown while Mode is Mix, or a split has a Mix side. No extra cost."
msgstr ""
"Koľko z mixu tvorí TAA hry, 0 - 100 % po 10 %: viac = pokojnejšie a mäkšie, menej = ostrejšie. "
"Zobrazí sa, keď je Režim Mix alebo delenie má stranu s mixom. Žiadne ďalšie náklady."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your graphics card. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, a lighter Glass "
"and fence fix, mirrors without Track moving parts. low = also no Smooth mirrors, no Glass and "
"fence fix, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Predvoľby pre vašu grafickú kartu. vysoká = všetko zapnuté (model 1). stredná = model 2, ľahšia "
"oprava skiel a plotov, zrkadlá bez sledovania pohyblivých dielov. nízka = navyše bez vyhladených "
"zrkadiel, bez opravy skiel a plotov, oblasť VR 60 %. Nikdy nemení nastavenie, ktoré ste zmenili "
"sami."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, fewest trails "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = najviac detailov, najostrejší text, asi 1,6x viac GPU ako 2. 2 (E) = vyvážený, najmenej "
"stôp za premávkou: začnite tu. 3 (F) = najpokojnejší na plotoch a drôtoch, môže rozmazať "
"pohybujúce sa detaily, rovnaká cena ako 2. 4 (M) = najnáročnejší (asi 5x), len na testy v plochom "
"režime."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the Glass and fence fix, the Light trail fix and "
"the DLAA area. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kvalita obrazu: doostrenie, ostrosť textúr, oprava skiel a plotov, oprava stôp svetiel a oblasť "
"DLAA. Vpravo skupinu otvorí, vľavo zatvorí; pri každom otvorení menu je zatvorená."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Doostrí obraz po DLAA, od 0 (vyp.) do 1,0. Zvýšte, ak je obraz mäkký; príliš veľa dáva svetlé "
"žiary na hranách. Stojí približne 0,1 ms; 0 tento prechod preskočí."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Ako ďaleko doostrenie siaha, 1 až 4 px: malé = jemné detaily, veľké = výraznejšie hrany. Zmeňte, "
"ak je doostrenie príliš jemné alebo hrubé; obraz väčší než obrazovka, ako vo VR, potrebuje viac "
"než 1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Ostrejší text na textúrach (dopravné značky, palubná doska, GPS). 0 = vyp.; čím zápornejšie, tým "
"ostrejšie, ale ploty viac blikajú; skúste -0,5 až -1, ak je text rozmazaný. Skoro nič nestojí."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaves: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it if "
"grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Works only while Texture sharpness is not 0. "
"Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"To isté pre drôtené ploty, trávu a lístie: zvýšte k 0, keď ploty blikajú, znížte, keď tráva "
"vyzerá mäkko. rovnako = ako riadok vyššie. Funguje, len keď Ostrosť textúr nie je 0. Skoro nič "
"nestojí."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Wires, fences and windows are treated as the thing in front, not as what you see through them, so "
"they do not smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms "
"per eye."
msgstr ""
"Drôty, ploty a okná sa berú ako to, čo je vpredu, a nie ako to, čo je cez ne vidieť, takže sa pri "
"pohybe nerozmazávajú. Vypnite, ak tam rozmazanie nevidíte: ušetrí 0,02 - 0,06 ms na oko."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: the glows are "
"drawn fresh each frame instead of being blended with older frames. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp "
"glows flicker, 0 = off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Zabráni tomu, aby žiara pouličných lámp a svetiel áut nechávala za sebou stopu, keď sa hýbete: "
"žiara sa kreslí v každej snímke odznova namiesto miešania so staršími snímkami. Kroky po 25 %; "
"znížte, ak žiara bliká, 0 = vyp. Stojí asi 0,05 - 0,2 ms na oko."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: DLAA dostane len stred každého oka (20 až 100 %); okraj ostane s obrazom hry. Znížte pre "
"ťažší model alebo vyššie fps; 40 % stojí približne 40 % modelu. Nastavuje aj kamión v garáži / "
"hlavnom menu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Ako DLAA zaobchádza s pohyblivými dielmi a zrkadlami kamióna. Doprava skupinu otvorí, Doľava "
"zatvorí; pri každom otvorení menu je zatvorená."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA follows each moving thing on its own (traffic, wheels, number plates), so it stays sharp and "
"leaves no trail. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: everything then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"DLAA sleduje každú pohybujúcu sa vec zvlášť (premávka, kolesá, evidenčné čísla), takže zostane "
"ostrý a nezanecháva stopy. Vypnite len kvôli úspore asi 0,5 ms na oko alebo na test: potom sa "
"všetko hýbe s kamerou a premávka sa rozmazáva."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Smooths the truck mirrors too, so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can leave "
"trails in the glass; the others follow each moving thing."
msgstr ""
"Vyhladzuje aj zrkadlá kamióna, aby nebliakali. 1 zrkadlo = len najväčšie (hlavné vedľa vás). "
"všetky = každé zrkadlo. kamera = najlacnejšie na zrkadlo, idúce autá môžu v zrkadle nechať stopy; "
"ostatné sledujú každú pohybujúcu sa vec."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"zap. = každé zrkadlo dostane DLAA každú 2. snímku a medzitým ukazuje posledný čistý obraz: "
"približne polovica ceny zrkadiel. Hrany ostanú čisté; pohyb v skle sa obnovuje polovičnou "
"rýchlosťou. vyp. = každé zrkadlo každú snímku."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate and CPU: CPU tuning, AMD cache cores, an FPS cap and Low delay (Reflex) for flat, an "
"FPS cap for VR. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Snímková frekvencia a CPU: ladenie CPU, jadrá s cache AMD, limit FPS a Nízke oneskorenie (Reflex) "
"pre plochý režim, limit FPS pre VR. Vpravo skupinu otvorí, vľavo zatvorí; pri každom otvorení "
"menu je zatvorená."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together. Prefer fast cores: only Intel CPUs with P-cores and E-cores. Higher "
"priority and no Windows power saving for the game: every CPU, Intel and AMD. Helps when the CPU "
"is the limit; no cost. Separate in dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Tri prepínače CPU spolu. Uprednostniť rýchle jadrá: len procesory Intel s jadrami P a E. Vyššia "
"priorita a žiadne šetrenie energie Windows pre hru: každý CPU, Intel aj AMD. Pomáha, keď je "
"limitom CPU; nič nestojí. Osobitne v dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"AMD X3D CPUs with two core groups (7950X3D, 9950X3D): keeps the game on the cores with the big 3D "
"V-Cache, which games like. Switches at once; off gives the game all cores back. Try it and "
"compare in a busy city. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Procesory AMD X3D s dvoma skupinami jadier (7950X3D, 9950X3D): drží hru na jadrách s veľkou cache "
"3D V-Cache, ktorú hry majú rady. Prepne sa hneď; vyp. vráti hre všetky jadrá. Skúste to a "
"porovnajte vo frekventovanom meste. Nič nestojí."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Low delay (Reflex) on, the NVIDIA "
"driver does the limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Len plochý režim. Drží hru najviac na tejto snímkovej frekvencii: stály čas snímky, menej tepla a "
"spotreby. Nastavte trochu pod to, čo váš počítač zvládne vo frekventovanom meste. Pri zapnutom "
"Nízkom oneskorení (Reflex) limituje ovládač NVIDIA. vyp. = bez limitu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only (NVIDIA Reflex). On = the game's frames wait less before the graphics card "
"draws them: less delay between your steering and the picture when the card is the limit. Boost "
"also keeps the card's clocks up. Same fps; small cost."
msgstr ""
"Len plochý režim, len NVIDIA (NVIDIA Reflex). Zap. = snímky hry čakajú menej, kým ich grafická "
"karta vykreslí: menšie oneskorenie medzi riadením a obrazom, keď je limitom karta. Boost navyše "
"drží vysoké takty karty. Rovnaké fps; malá cena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills in the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it "
"when the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Len VR. polovica = hra kreslí každú 2. snímku headsetu (72 Hz -> 36 fps), tretina = každú 3.; "
"vyhladzovanie snímok headsetu (ASW / Motion Smoothing) doplní zvyšok v stálom rytme. Použite, keď "
"fps kolíše. Po zapnutí vypne Turbo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering, skipping the hidden lens edges, and whether OFXR Bridge "
"/ VectorXR are found. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu "
"opens."
msgstr ""
"Zrýchlenia VR: Turbo, foveated rendering, vynechanie skrytých okrajov šošoviek a či sú nájdené "
"OFXR Bridge / VectorXR. Vpravo skupinu otvorí, vľavo zatvorí; pri každom otvorení menu je "
"zatvorená."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo switches off the headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). VR only. On = "
"the game stops waiting for the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy "
"cities, traffic). Turn it off if the picture judders."
msgstr ""
"Turbo vypne vyhladzovanie snímok headsetu (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). Len VR. Zap. = hra v "
"každej snímke nečaká na headset: viac fps len vtedy, keď je limitom CPU (frekventované mestá, "
"premávka). Vypnite, ak sa obraz trhá."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring gets one colour per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Ostrý stred, menej detailov na okraji (len NVIDIA RTX). Šetrí čas GPU pri vysokom Škálovaní. Len "
"VR. Vonkajší prstenec dostane jednu farbu na 2 x 2 pixely; ploty, tráva a lístie si zachovajú "
"plný detail. Vypnite, ak okraj vyzerá kockovane."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated rendering is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the "
"view sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Ako veľký je ostrý stred Foveated rendering, 10 - 100 % po 5 %: väčší = viac obrazu ostrého, "
"menšia úspora; menší = väčšia úspora, nižší detail začína bližšie k stredu. Predvolené je 80 % "
"(vyvážený); 90 = široký, 65 = úzky."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What Foveated rendering makes coarser. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + lighting = "
"also the game's lighting, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for blocky light or "
"shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"Čo Foveated rendering zhrubí. scéna = len 3D svet (predvolené). scéna + osvetlenie = aj "
"osvetlenie hry, len na samom okraji: väčšia úspora. Vyskúšajte: hľadajte kockované okraje svetiel "
"alebo tieňov na boku zorného poľa."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated rendering is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Aký hrubý je vonkajší prstenec Foveated rendering. Normálny = 1 farba na 2 x 2 pixely "
"(predvolené). Silný = na 4 x 2, Max. = na 4 x 4: väčšia úspora GPU, kockovanejšie okraje. "
"Najlepšie so sledovaním očí, kde sa na vonkajší prstenec nikdy nepozeráte."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated rendering follows your eyes on a headset with eye "
"tracking (for example Varjo); without it the centre stays in the middle of the lens. Needs "
"Foveated rendering on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Experimentálne. Ostrý stred Foveated rendering sleduje vaše oči v headsete so sledovaním očí "
"(napríklad Varjo); bez neho zostáva stred uprostred šošovky. Vyžaduje zapnuté Foveated rendering "
"pri štarte hry, inak reštart. Skoro nič nestojí."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Len VR. Hra preskočí rohy šošoviek, ktoré nikdy nevidíte (headset ich hlási), takže kreslí menej "
"pixelov: viac rezervy GPU, viditeľný obraz ostane rovnaký. Prvé zapnutie vyžaduje reštart hry. "
"Vypnite, ak okraj záberu vyzerá zle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = generovanie snímok pre VR od djules75, samostatné stiahnutie "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). nájdené = jeho vrstva je v tejto hre načítaná a mód nechá jej "
"prácu prejsť. Spustite jeho aplikáciu v oznamovacej oblasti pred hrou."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = sada vylepšení OpenXR od DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, hĺbka, "
"generovanie snímok; nájdené = jeho vrstva je v hre načítaná a mód nechá jej prácu prejsť. "
"Používajte len jedno Turbo (jeho alebo módu)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the game's own VR UI floats (HUD, menus). The mod types the change into the game's console "
"for you; needs g_developer and g_console 1 in config.cfg. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Kde sa vznáša vlastné VR rozhranie hry (HUD, ponuky). Mód zadá zmenu do konzoly hry za vás; "
"potrebuje g_developer a g_console 1 v config.cfg. Doprava skupinu otvorí, Doľava zatvorí."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's VR UI layouts the rows below move: driving (the HUD while driving) or menus "
"(the game's menu screens)."
msgstr ""
"Ktoré z rozložení VR rozhrania hry riadky nižšie posúvajú: jazda (HUD pri jazde) alebo ponuky "
"(obrazovky ponúk hry)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the game's VR UI: height, side, distance, tilt, turn, size or curve, in small steps. The "
"game gets each change about 0.4 s after your last press: the console opens and closes by itself."
msgstr ""
"Posúva VR rozhranie hry: výšku, stranu, vzdialenosť, náklon, otočenie, veľkosť alebo zakrivenie, "
"po malých krokoch. Hra dostane každú zmenu asi 0,4 s po poslednom stlačení: konzola sa otvorí a "
"zatvorí sama."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Right: every value of both layouts back to what config.cfg had at the start (the game saves its "
"own values when it exits)."
msgstr ""
"Doprava: všetky hodnoty oboch rozložení späť na to, čo malo config.cfg na začiatku (hra si svoje "
"hodnoty ukladá pri ukončení)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR): fps, ms, "
"numbers only, each with or without a graph of recent frame times (spikes show red), or the graph "
"alone. Its GPU cost is measured. Save keeps it."
msgstr ""
"Malé živé okno s fps a časom snímky, aj keď je menu zatvorené (plochý režim aj VR): fps, ms, len "
"čísla, každé s grafom nedávnych časov snímok (špičky sú červené) alebo bez neho, prípadne len "
"graf. Jeho cena GPU sa meria. Uloženie ho zachová."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Zámok, poloha, veľkosť, farba, vzdialenosť vo VR a natočenie boxu fps. Doprava skupinu otvorí, "
"Doľava zatvorí; pri každom otvorení menu je zatvorená."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Posúva box fps do strán, v % obrazovky (VR pevný / pripevnený: stupne okolo vás). Plochý režim a "
"VR majú každý svoju polohu. Bez ceny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Posúva box fps hore / dole, v % obrazovky (VR pevný / pripevnený: stupne, mínus = hore). Plochý "
"režim a VR majú každý svoju polohu. Bez ceny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Zväčší alebo zmenší box fps (0,2 .. 3,0). Zvýšte, ak ho v headsete alebo na veľkej obrazovke "
"neprečítate. Bez ceny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Farba textu boxu fps: 20 farieb, každá s obrysom, aby bola čitateľná na akomkoľvek obraze (čierna "
"na bielej = tmavý text, biely obrys). Plochý režim aj VR. Bez ceny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Jas boxu fps, 10 - 100 %: 100 = farba bez zmeny, nižšie stmaví text (obrys ostane) k čiernej. "
"Použite na stlmenie počítadla v noci alebo v headsete. Plochý režim aj VR. Bez ceny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Aký nepriehľadný je celý box fps, 10 - 100 %: 100 = plný, nižšie slabne text AJ jeho čierny obrys "
"spoločne, takže stlmený box neprejde na čiernu škvrnu. Plochý režim aj VR. Bez ceny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far back the fps graph shows: 2 - 60 s. One bar per slice of time = its slowest frame, so you "
"see spikes. Green = on time, yellow = a bit slow, red = a hitch; the line = the headset rate / "
"FPS cap / your usual. Shown when FPS counter has a graph."
msgstr ""
"Ako ďaleko do minulosti graf fps siaha: 2 - 60 s. Jeden stĺpec na úsek času = jeho najpomalšia "
"snímka, takže vidíte špičky. Zelená = včas, žltá = trochu pomaly, červená = zasekanie; čiara = "
"frekvencia headsetu / limit FPS / vaša obvyklá. Zobrazí sa, keď má Počítadlo FPS graf."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + Track "
"moving parts). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Len VR. Za hlavou = hýbe sa s headsetom. Pevný v hernom priestore = jedno miesto okolo vášho "
"sedadla, ignoruje húpanie kabíny. Pripevnený k vozidlu = prilepený ku kabíne, húpe sa s ňou "
"(potrebuje DLAA + Sledovať pohyblivé diely). Nič nestojí."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR, len Pripevnený k vozidlu. zap. = každý kamión / auto má vlastné miesto boxu fps v kabíne, "
"natočenie, veľkosť, farbu, jas a text (uložené v dlaa.ini pri zatvorení menu). vyp. = jedna "
"spoločná sada pre všetky vozidlá. Bez ceny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"VR, len Pripevnený k vozidlu. Doprava = znova zmerať kabínu hneď (sedte v pokoji, zaparkovaní), "
"ak box sedí vedľa. Doľava = box tohto vozidla späť na predvolené (miesto, natočenie, veľkosť, "
"farba, text); ostatné vozidlá si ponechajú svoje. Box je kolmý na kabínu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Len VR, preto je v plochom režime sivé. Otáča box fps doľava / doprava okolo vlastnej osi, v "
"stupňoch (+ = jeho čelná strana sa otáča doprava). Použite na natočenie boxu, keď je pri okraji. "
"0 = smeruje k vám. Bez ceny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Len VR, preto je v plochom režime sivé. Nakláňa box fps, v stupňoch (+ = jeho horný okraj sa "
"odkláňa od vás, ako by ležal na palubnej doske). 0 = smeruje k vám. Bez ceny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Len VR, preto je v plochom režime sivé. Otáča box fps vo vlastnej rovine, v stupňoch (+ = v smere "
"hodinových ručičiek). 0 = rovno. Bez ceny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Len VR, preto je v plochom režime sivé. Ako ďaleko box fps pláva, 0,30 - 3,00 m. Zachováva "
"rovnakú veľkosť v zábere pri každej vzdialenosti; mení sa len hĺbka. Dajte ho blízko hĺbky, na "
"ktorú sa pozeráte, aby ste ho prečítali bez zaostrovania. Bez ceny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Poloha, veľkosť, hĺbka a natočenie panela a klávesy menu. Doprava skupinu otvorí, Doľava zatvorí; "
"pri každom otvorení menu je zatvorená."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Posúva panel do strán, v % obrazovky (VR pevný v kabíne: stupne okolo sedadla). Plochý režim a VR "
"majú každý svoju polohu. Použite, keď panel zakrýva niečo, čo potrebujete. Bez ceny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Posúva panel hore / dole, v % obrazovky (VR pevný v kabíne: stupne, plus = dole). Plochý režim a "
"VR majú každý svoju polohu. Použite, keď panel zakrýva niečo, čo potrebujete. Bez ceny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Zväčší alebo zmenší panel. Zvýšte, ak ho neprečítate, znížte, ak zakrýva príliš. Plochý režim a "
"VR majú každý svoju veľkosť. Bez ceny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Len VR. Za hlavou = panel sa hýbe s headsetom. Pevný v kabíne = ostane na jednom mieste pred "
"sedadlom, stabilný pri obzeraní; X / Y / hĺbka potom toto miesto nastavia (stupne, metre). "
"Vyžaduje vrstvu VR (predvolené). Bez ceny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Len VR, preto je v plochom režime sivé. Ako ďaleko panel pláva: v metroch (0,30 - 3,00) ako "
"vrstva VR, predvolené; v px posunu dovnútra na oko s menu_vr_layer = 0. Rovnaká veľkosť v každej "
"hĺbke. Zmeňte, ak je pohľad na panel namáhavý. Bez ceny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Len VR, preto je v plochom režime sivé. zap. = panel sa otočí k vám, keď ho posuniete do strany, "
"rovnaká veľkosť z každého uhla (ako vrstva VR, predvolené, aj box fps sledujúci hlavu); vyp. = "
"plochý obraz. Bez ceny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches for comparing: DLAA off, the game's own TAA mixed in or side by side, the wire fixes, "
"running DLAA earlier. Nothing here is needed for normal driving. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it."
msgstr ""
"Prepínače na porovnanie: DLAA vyp., vlastné TAA hry primiešané alebo vedľa seba, opravy drôtov, "
"skoršie spustenie DLAA. Nič z toho nie je potrebné na bežnú jazdu. Vpravo skupinu otvorí, vľavo "
"zatvorí."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Zapne alebo vypne celý mód a zapamätá si režim; vyp. ukáže obraz samotnej hry na porovnanie. Vyp. "
"ušetrí cenu všetkých častí dokopy."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = the mod on the left, the game's own TAA on the right, to compare (Split line position, "
"Split: left | right). Replaces Mix while on. With the game's console on, the mod switches the "
"game's Anti-aliasing for you."
msgstr ""
"zap. = mod vľavo, vlastné TAA hry vpravo, na porovnanie (Poloha deliacej čiary, Delenie: vľavo | "
"vpravo). Kým je zapnuté, nahrádza Mix. Pri zapnutej konzole hry mod prepne vyhladzovanie hry za "
"vás."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the split line is, 0 - 100 % of the width in 5 % steps: the mod's DLAA / DLSS on the left "
"of it, the game's TAA on the right. Used only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Kde je deliaca čiara, 0 - 100 % šírky po 5 %: vľavo od nej DLAA / DLSS modu, vpravo TAA hry. "
"Použije sa len keď je zapnuté Delenie s TAA hry."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What the split shows on its two sides: DLAA | TAA (the mod left, the game's TAA right), Mix | TAA "
"or DLAA | Mix (Mix = the two blended at Mix amount). DLSS instead of DLAA when upscaling. Used "
"only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Čo delenie ukazuje na oboch stranách: DLAA | TAA (mod vľavo, TAA hry vpravo), mix | TAA alebo "
"DLAA | mix (mix = obe zmiešané podľa Podielu mixu). DLSS namiesto DLAA pri zväčšovaní. Použije sa "
"len keď je zapnuté Delenie s TAA hry."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires move correctly while you drive: their movement is spread over the whole thin line. on "
"= default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is soft for a moment when "
"you switch."
msgstr ""
"Tenké drôty sa pri jazde hýbu správne: ich pohyb sa rozloží na celú tenkú čiaru. zap. = "
"predvolené. vyp. = len na porovnanie; blízke drôty viac blikajú. Po prepnutí je obraz chvíľu "
"mäkký."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires count as in front on every pixel they touch, even where they cover only a sliver of "
"it. on = default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges such as leaves. off = only to compare; "
"near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Tenké drôty sa počítajú ako vpredu na každom pixeli, ktorého sa dotknú, aj keď ho pokrývajú len "
"kúsok. zap. = predvolené. zap. (bez A2C) = aj pre priehľadné okraje, napríklad lístie. vyp. = len "
"na porovnanie; blízke drôty viac blikajú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Experimentálne: vykreslí vzdialené drôty tenšie než 1 pixel ako čiaru s 1 pixelom, aby sa "
"netrhali na čiarky. Predvolene vyp.: vzdialené drôty môžu vyzerať tmavšie alebo blikať viac. "
"Vyskúšajte a porovnajte."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA runs before the game adds its glow and colour look, so lane paint, wires and "
"rails shimmer less. Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscaling or Windows HDR. Same "
"cost either way; takes about a second to switch."
msgstr ""
"Len plochý režim: DLAA beží skôr, než hra pridá žiaru a farebný vzhľad, takže farba na ceste, "
"drôty a koľajnice blikajú menej. Meňte len na porovnanie. Nepoužije sa so škálovaním DLSS ani s "
"Windows HDR. Rovnaká cena; prepnutie trvá asi sekundu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Bug report: press the capture key twice (or Capture now) where something looks wrong; the mod "
"writes one zip you attach to a GitHub issue. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Hlásenie chyby: dvakrát stlačte kláves záznamu (alebo Zaznamenať teraz) tam, kde niečo vyzerá "
"zle; mod uloží jeden zip, ktorý priložíte k hláseniu na GitHube. Vpravo skupinu otvorí, vľavo "
"zatvorí."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"One switch for the most complete report: log detail debug, rewind 2 s, capture Full. Off puts the "
"rows back as they were. Only this switch is saved; the forced values are never written to "
"dlaa.ini."
msgstr ""
"Jeden prepínač pre najúplnejšie hlásenie: úroveň logu debug, pretočenie 2 s, záznam Plný. Vyp. "
"vráti riadky tak, ako boli. Ukladá sa len tento prepínač; vynútené hodnoty sa do dlaa.ini nikdy "
"nezapisujú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics and timing "
"measurements (a little slower)."
msgstr ""
"Čo sa zapisuje do dlaa_inject.log: vyp. = nič; chyby = len zlyhania (predvolené); varovania = + "
"obídené problémy; info = + štart a zmeny; ladenie = + štatistiky a merania času (trochu pomalšie)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Keeps the last 0.5 - 3 s of frames on the graphics card all the time, so the report shows the "
"moment BEFORE the key (+ what DLSS got for the last frames). Costs graphics memory (the MB in the "
"cost column) and a picture copy per frame. off = none."
msgstr ""
"Drží posledných 0,5 - 3 s snímok neustále na grafickej karte, takže hlásenie ukáže okamih PRED "
"stlačením klávesu (+ čo dostal DLSS v posledných snímkach). Stojí grafickú pamäť (MB v stĺpci "
"ceny) a kópiu obrazu na snímku. vyp. = nič."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Quick = system info, logs, settings, your picture and DLAA off for a few frames (about 1 s). Full "
"= + what DLSS got per frame (colour, motion, depth) and A/B sets: motion view, motion off, jitter "
"only (about 2 - 4 s)."
msgstr ""
"Rýchly = informácie o systéme, logy, nastavenia, váš obraz a DLAA vyp. na pár snímok (asi 1 s). "
"Plný = + čo dostal DLSS na snímku (farba, pohyb, hĺbka) a sady A/B: pohľad na pohyb, pohyb vyp., "
"len jitter (asi 2 - 4 s)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The capture key. Press it TWICE within 1 s while driving where it goes wrong (the first press "
"only arms it: one short beep). Right opens the Hotkeys page on its line to change it."
msgstr ""
"Kláves záznamu. Stlačte ho DVAKRÁT do 1 s pri jazde tam, kde sa niečo pokazí (prvé stlačenie ho "
"len pripraví: jedno krátke pípnutie). Vpravo otvorí stránku Skratiek na jeho riadku, kde ho "
"zmeníte."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How many captures stay in the dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL: older ones (folder + zip) are "
"deleted when a new one is written. all = never delete."
msgstr ""
"Koľko záznamov zostane v priečinku dlaa_selftest vedľa DLL: staršie (priečinok + zip) sa zmažú, "
"keď vznikne nový. všetky = nikdy nemazať."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Jazyk tohto menu. auto = jazyk hry (predvolené); Doľava / Doprava vyberie iný. Linux / Proton: "
"čínština, japončina a kórejčina potrebujú nainštalované písma, pozri README. Súbor "
"lang\\<code>.po vedľa DLL má prednosť, na vaše vlastné opravy. Uložiť ho zachová. Bez ceny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Každá klávesová skratka tohto menu, jeden riadok na akciu, s klávesom klávesnice a tlačidlom "
"ovládača. Doprava otvorí zoznam; vyberte akciu Doprava, potom stlačte nový kláves alebo tlačidlo "
"volantu. Ukladá sa hneď do dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Zapíše všetko tu zobrazené do dlaa.ini (nastavenia a polohy panela / boxu fps, keď ste ich "
"posunuli), ostatné riadky zachová. Urobte to, keď sa vám výsledok páči, inak sú zmeny pri ďalšom "
"štarte preč. Režim sa ukladá sám."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, preset, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, CPU, log "
"detail), live and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Vráti každé nastavenie v tomto menu na stav, v akom mod prichádza (model, doostrenie, ostrosť "
"textúr, oblasť DLAA, pohyb, zrkadlá, predvoľba, panel, okno fps, turbo, foveated, snímková "
"frekvencia, CPU, úroveň logu), naživo aj v dlaa.ini, a ponechá vaše skratky a všetky ostatné "
"riadky."

