#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%hs = capture now (the menu closes first). The zip (dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL) holds "
"system info, the mod's and the game's log, dlaa.ini, your picture and DLAA off; Full adds what "
"DLSS got and the A/B sets; rewind adds the moment before. Your user name and home folder are "
"removed. %ls"
msgstr ""
"%hs = zaznamenať teraz (menu sa najprv zatvorí). Zip (priečinok dlaa_selftest vedľa DLL) obsahuje "
"informácie o systéme, log modu a hry, dlaa.ini, váš obraz a DLAA vyp.; Plný pridá, čo dostal "
"DLSS, a sady A/B; pretočenie pridá okamih pred stlačením. Vaše používateľské meno a domovský "
"priečinok sa odstránia. %ls"

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The 5 keys that open and drive this menu: %hs opens / closes it (the value), %hs / %hs / %hs / "
"%hs move (Hotkey column). While the menu is open only these 5 are kept from the game. %hs: change "
"them on the Hotkeys page."
msgstr ""
"5 klávesov, ktoré otvárajú a ovládajú toto menu: %hs menu otvára / zatvára (hodnota), %hs / %hs / "
"%hs / %hs sa pohybujú (stĺpec Kláves). Pri otvorenom menu sa hre berie len týchto 5. %hs: zmeníte "
"ich na stránke Skratky."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Closes the menu; the 5 menu keys go back to the game. %hs does the same from any row."
msgstr "Zatvorí menu; 5 klávesov menu sa vráti hre. %hs robí to isté z ktoréhokoľvek riadka."

